   "part": 1,
   "pin": null,
   "question": "",
   "quote": "collapsing those into `WALLET_ERROR` makes the error code to the user too vague. `WALLET_ERROR` is really for \"something bad happened in the wallet internally\", as opposed to \"the user gave us a bad a\"",
